    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, the strike of your fists grow more potent, and each punch resounds a challenge to the creature you strike.</p>\n<p>You can roll a d6 in place of the normal damage of your unarmed strikes. If you aren't wielding a weapon or a shield, you can roll a d8 instead.</p>\n<p>Additionally, when you hit a creature with an unarmed strike while raging, that creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against creatures other than you until the start of your next turn.</p>",
